    "content_text": "&nbsp;View printer-friendly version \nCharles River Laboratories to Present at Morgan Stanley and Baird Conferences\nPDF Version \nWILMINGTON, Mass. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Sep. 11, 2026--\nCharles River Laboratories International, Inc. (NYSE: CRL) announced today that it will present at two upcoming investor conferences, including:\nMorgan Stanley 24 th Annual Global Healthcare Conference on Monday, September 14 th , at 10:00 a.m. ET ; and\nBaird 2026 Global Healthcare Conference on Tuesday, September 15 th , at 9:40 a.m. ET .\nManagement will present an overview of Charles River’s strategic focus, business developments, and recent trends.\nA live webcast of each presentation will be available through a link that will be posted on the Investor Relations section of the Charles River website at ir.criver.com . A webcast replay will be accessible through the same website after each presentation and will remain available for at least two weeks.\nAbout Charles River \nCharles River provides essential products and services to help pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies, government agencies and leading academic institutions around the globe accelerate their research and drug development efforts. Our dedicated employees are focused on providing clients with exactly what they need to improve and expedite the discovery, early-stage development and safe manufacture of new therapies for the patients who need them. To learn more about our unique portfolio and breadth of services, visit www.criver.com .\nView source version on businesswire.com: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260911072567/en/ \nInvestor Relations Contact:\nTodd Spencer\nCorporate Vice President, Investor Relations\n781.222.6455\ntodd.spencer@crl.com \nSource: Charles River Laboratories International, Inc.",
    "content_source_url": "https://ir.criver.com/news-releases/news-release-details/charles-river-laboratories-present-morgan-stanley-and-baird",
    "content_excerpt": "&nbsp;View printer-friendly version Charles River Laboratories to Present at Morgan Stanley and Baird Conferences PDF Version WILMINGTON, Mass. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Sep. 11, 2026-- Charles River Laboratories International, Inc. (NYSE: CRL) announced today that it will present at two upcoming investor conferences, including: Morgan Stanley 24 th Annual Global Healthcare Conference on Monday, September 14 th , at 10:00 a.m. ET ; and Baird 2026 Global Healthcare Conference on Tuesday, September 15 th , at 9:40 a.m. ET . Management will present an overview of Charles River’s strategic focus, business developments, and recent trends. A live webcast of each presentation will be available through a link that will be posted on the Investor Relations section of the Charles River website at ir.criver....",
