    "content_text": "Energy Fuels completes acquisition of ASM\n31/08/2026\nRoss Bhappu, President & CEO of Energy Fuels with Rowena Smith, CEO of ASM. \nAustralian Strategic Materials (ASM) is pleased to confirm that Energy Fuels Inc. has completed its 100% acquisition of ASM , by way of a members’ scheme of arrangement ( Share Scheme ). \nImplementation of the Share Scheme took place on 28 August 2026, and ASM was removed from&nbsp;the official list of ASX on&nbsp;31 August 2026.&nbsp;&nbsp;\nIn accordance with the Share Scheme, Energy Fuels has confirmed that eligible ASM Shareholders have been issued with the Share Scheme Consideration of 0.053 New Energy Fuels CHESS&nbsp;Depositary&nbsp;Interests (CDIs) –&nbsp;or New Energy Fuels Shares, if validly elected&nbsp;–&nbsp;and all ASM Shareholders have been paid the Cash Consideration of A$0.13 for each ASM Share held as at the Share Scheme Record Date.&nbsp;&nbsp;\nNew Energy Fuels CDIs have been trading on ASX on a deferred settlement basis since Thursday, 20 August 2026 and commenced&nbsp;trading on a normal settlement basis on ASX from Monday, 31 August 2026. \nFirst settlement of New Energy Fuels CDIs traded on ASX will occur on Wednesday, 2 September 2026. New Energy Fuels Shares issued under the Share Scheme will&nbsp;commence&nbsp;trading on the NYSE American and TSX from Friday, 28 August 2026 (Eastern Time).\n“We are excited to join Energy Fuels and contribute to a leading Western rare earth supply chain, and I would like to thank ASM employees and shareholders for their support in getting us to this point. The combination of Energy Fuels and ASM&nbsp;represents&nbsp;a major step forward in the development of a secure, diversified rare earth platform that the world increasingly needs, and we look forward to&nbsp;demonstrating&nbsp;the value that the combined company will bring.”&nbsp; \nRowena Smith, Managing Director & CEO \nRead the ASX Announcement \nRead the Energy Fuels Announcement \nVisit the Energy Fuels website",
    "content_source_url": "https://asm-au.com/energy-fuels-completes-acquisition-of-asm/",
