    "content_text": "Title Sponsor of IZUMO OROCHI FES 2026, One of the Biggest Music Festivals in the San’in Region\nAugust 25, 2026 \nProterial, Ltd.\nProterial, Ltd. (hereinafter, “Proterial”) announces that it will be participating in “Proterial presents IZUMO OROCHI FES 2026,” one of the biggest music festivals in the San’in region, as title sponsor. \nIZUMO OROCHI FES is a music festival organized by San-in Chuo Television Broadcasting (TSK). It started in 2024 with the aim of “energizing the San’in region with music” as no big music festival had existed in the region up to that point.\nProterial has as its main factory for specialty steel the Yasugi Works, which has its roots in the Unpaku-Steel Limited partnership that was founded in Yasugi, Shimane Prefecture in 1899 (Meiji 32), and so has been active in the San’in region for more than a century, developing alongside the local community. Proterial supports the idea of “energizing the San’in region with music” because of gratitude to the region that has been the company’s companion for such a long time as well as a wish for the region to be revitalized, and this is what motivated Proterial’s decision to support the event as title sponsor.\nThis will be the third year of IZUMO OROCHI FES as it has grown to become one of the San’in region’s biggest and most well-visited music festivals. Taking part as title sponsor this time, Proterial intends to promote the event so that as many visitors as possible can enjoy it and as a way to help the San’in region thrive even more.\nEvent Outline\nEvent name: \r\nProterial presents IZUMO OROCHI FES 2026 \r\nDate: \r\nSeptember 26 (Sat) to 27 (Sun), 2026 \r\nVenue: \r\nMatsue City General Gymnasium \r\nOrganizers: \r\nSan-in Chuo Television Broadcasting (TSK), FM-Sanin \r\nTitle sponsor: \r\nProterial, Ltd. \r\nOfficial website:\nhttps://izumoorochifes.jp/ \nMedia Inquiries: Corporate Communications Dept.\nhttps://www.cntct.proterial.com/contact/publish/inquiry_eng?g=01&c=001-01 \nCustomer Inquiries:\nhttps://www.proterial.com/e/contact/ \nTitle Sponsor of IZUMO OROCHI FES 2026, One of the Biggest Music Festivals in the San’in Region [PDF: ] \n2026",
