    "content_excerpt": "Title Sponsor of IZUMO OROCHI FES 2026, One of the Biggest Music Festivals in the San’in Region August 25, 2026 Proterial, Ltd. Proterial, Ltd. (hereinafter, “Proterial”) announces that it will be participating in “Proterial presents IZUMO OROCHI FES 2026,” one of the biggest music festivals in the San’in region, as title sponsor. IZUMO OROCHI FES is a music festival organized by San-in Chuo Television Broadcasting (TSK). It started in 2024 with the aim of “energizing the San’in region with music” as no big music festival had existed in the region up to that point. Proterial has as its main factory for specialty steel the Yasugi Works, which has its roots in the Unpaku-Steel Limited partnership that was founded in Yasugi, Shimane Prefecture in 1899 (Meiji 32), and so has been active in the...",
