    "title": "Empaveli™ Approved in Japan for Additional Rare Kidney Disease Indications of C3 Glomerulopathy and Primary Immune Complex Membranoproliferative Glomerulonephritis",
    "url": "https://www.asahi-kasei.com/news/2026/e260824",
