    "source_direct_url": "https://www.borgwarner.com/newsroom/press-releases/2026/08/05/borgwarner-reports-strong-second-quarter-2026-results--increases-2026-adjusted-eps-guidance-and-share-repurchase-authorization-by--1-billion--announces-7-awards-across-portfolio-to-support-long-term-profitable-growth",
