    "content_text": "For Immediate Release\nCompany Name:\nRepresentative:\nSecurities Code:\nStock Exchange\nListings:\nInquiries:\nAugust 4, 2026\nSumitomo Chemical Co., Ltd.\nNobuaki Mito\nRepresentative Director & President\n4005\nTokyo Stock Exchange Prime Market\nShoko Wato\nGeneral Manager\nCorporate Communications Dept.\n(Tel: +81-3-5201-0200)\nAnnouncement Regarding Report on the Group\nSumitomo Pharma Co., Ltd., a subsidiary of Sumitomo Chemical, today announced its views on a\nreport concerning the company. For further details, please see the attachment.\nAugust 4, 2026\nSumitomo Pharma Co., Ltd.\nRegarding a Report Concerning Sumitomo Pharma\nSumitomo Pharma Co., Ltd. (Head Office: Osaka, Japan; Representative Director, President and\nCEO: Toru Kimura; the “Company”) has confirmed that a report concerning the Company and its\ngroup companies was published by Gotham City Research LLC on August 3, 2026. The report\nreflects the independent views and assertions of its author and was not issued by the Company.\nThe Company prepares and discloses its consolidated financial statements and financial\nstatements (the “Financial Statements”) in accordance with applicable laws, regulations, and\naccounting standards. Such Financial Statements are audited by an independent auditor in\naccordance with the Financial Instruments and Exchange Act and the Companies Act of Japan,\nand the independent auditor has issued an unqualified audit opinion. With respect to the allegations\nin the report regarding misstatements in the Financial Statements and related disclosures and\ninappropriate accounting treatment, the Company has not confirmed any such facts at this time.\nAccordingly, as of the date of this release, the Company has no plans to revise the Financial\nStatements previously disclosed by the Company.\nThe Company remains committed to timely and appropriate disclosure of information.\nContact:\nCorporate Communications\nSumitomo Pharma Co., Ltd.\nE-mail: prir@sumitomo-pharma.co.jp",
