    "content_text": "Dr. Dominic Dorfner assumes office as CEO of JENOPTIK AG\nThe Supervisory Board approves reorganization of Executive Board responsibilities and creates new CTO/COO role. \n03 August 2026 \nDr. Dominic Dorfner assumed his position as Chief Executive Officer (CEO) of JENOPTIK AG on August 1, 2026. He leads the photonics group together with Dr. Prisca Havranek-Kosicek and Dr. Ralf Kuschnereit. The Supervisory Board had unanimously appointed Dorfner at the end of March 2026 &nbsp;for a three-year term.\nWithin the Executive Board , Dr. Ralf Kuschnereit has assumed the newly created role of Chief Technology Officer and Chief Operating Officer (CTO/COO) effective August 1. In this role, he is responsible for functional excellence and the further development of the company&rsquo;s technology base. As CEO, Dr. Dominic Dorfner will oversee strategic and commercial responsibilities. Dr. Prisca Havranek-Kosicek will continue to lead the CFO areas of responsibility.\n&ldquo;Over the past few weeks, I&rsquo;ve already had the opportunity to get to know Jenoptik and many members of the team in Jena, as well as at other locations in Germany, the U.S., and Asia. The high level of technological expertise, our colleagues&rsquo; enthusiasm for their work, and the growing opportunities in photonics give us the best possible foundation to vigorously drive the company&rsquo;s further development together with Prisca Havranek-Kosicek and Ralf Kuschnereit,&rdquo; says Dr. Dominic Dorfner, Chairman of the Executive Board of JENOPTIK AG. &ldquo;With our Executive Board structure, we have the framework to consistently unlock the company&rsquo;s potential.&rdquo;\n&ldquo;The Supervisory Board looks forward to working with the Executive Board team and wishes them every success in their upcoming tasks,&rdquo; says Daniela Mattheus, Chairwoman of the Supervisory Board of JENOPTIK AG. &ldquo;Jenoptik possesses extraordinary technological excellence in optical and photonic solutions, as well as strong customer focus across four continents. We are convinced that, with this team and this structure, Jenoptik will resolutely capitalize on its market opportunities.&rdquo;\nImage, from left:&nbsp;Dr. Ralf Kuschnereit, Dr. Prisca Havranek-Kosicek, Dr. Dominic Dorfner. \nAbout Jenoptik\nJenoptik is a global technology group operating in the photonics market. Our core markets primarily include semiconductor technology, medical technology, metrology as well as smart mobility. Almost 4,500 people worldwide work for the Jenoptik Group, which is headquartered in Jena (Germany). JENOPTIK AG is listed on the German Stock Exchange in Frankfurt and traded on the MDax and TecDax. In fiscal year 2025, Jenoptik generated revenue of 1,046 million euros.\nContact\r\nCommunications and Marketing\n+49 3641 65-4455 \r\nContact us",
