    "content_text": "Availability of the Amendment to the 2025 Universal Registration Document and\n2026 half-yearly financial report (french and english version)\nParis, July 30, 2026.\nVeolia Environnement announces the filing with the French Financial Markets Authority (Autorité des marchés\nfinanciers - “AMF”) under the number D.26-0118-A01 and the availability to the public, on July 30, 2026, of the\nAmendment to the 2025 Universal Registration Document.\nThis Amendment incorporates the 2026 half-yearly financial report.\nIt is available on Veolia website :\nhttps://www.veolia.com/en/veolia-group/finance/regulated-information\nA hard copy of the version of this Amendment is also available at the company’s administrative headquarters :\n30 rue Madeleine Vionnet, Aubervilliers (93300), France, and may be provided free of charge on request.\nContacts Investor & Analysts relations:\nSelma Bekhechi - Tél +33 (0)1 85 57 84 76\nAriane de Lamaze - Tél +33 (0)1 85 57 84 80",
