    "content_text": "About Proterial’s Participation in the Formula SAE Japan 2026 as a Sponsor\nJuly 27, 2026 \nProterial, Ltd.\nProterial, Ltd. (hereinafter, Proterial) would like to announce that it will support the Formula SAE Japan 2026 as an S-class sponsor once again this year. \nThe Formula SAE Japan is an event where students compete in overall manufacturing ability with vehicles that they come up with, design, and produce by themselves. This year marks the 24rd holding of the event. The purpose is to train human resources who can contribute to the development and promotion of automotive technology and industry. Japanese and overseas automobile and automobile parts manufacturers, along with others who agree with the purpose, help organize the event as sponsors and assist the teams.\nProterial provides a range of high-performance materials for automobiles, including specialty steels, Electronic Materials, power electronics materials, magnetic materials, wire materials, and auto parts. Especially in recent years, Proterial has been focusing on eco-friendly products that ensure higher xEV efficiency, lower fuel consumption in ICVs (gasoline engine vehicles), and improved safety, aiming to achieve growth in the global market by implementing business strategies that enhance and expand such products. By continuing to support the Formula SAE Japan, Proterial will train human resources who will play an active role in the manufacturing field in the future, seek to improve technical capabilities, and contribute to industry development.\nFormula SAE Japan 2026\nDate \r\nSunday, August 2, 2026 to Wednesday, August 5, 2026 \r\nVehicle examinations / Static events \r\nWednesday, August 5, 2026 to Friday, August 7, 2026 \r\nDynamic events \r\nVenue \r\nAichi Sky Expo in Tokoname City, Aichi \r\nSponsored by \r\nSociety of Automotive Engineers of Japan, Inc. \r\nEntrance fees \r\nFree of charge \r\nReference: Formula SAE Japan 2026 website of the Society of Automotive Engineers of Japan\nhttps://en.jsae.or.jp/formula/ \nPhotos: Formula SAE Japan 2025 \r\nMedia Inquiries: Corporate Communications Dept.\nhttps://www.cntct.proterial.com/contact/publish/inquiry_eng?g=01&c=001-01 \nAbout Proterial’s Participation in the Formula SAE Japan 2026 as a Sponsor [PDF: ] \n2026",
