    "content_excerpt": "West Announces First-Quarter 2025 Results, Increases Adjusted-Diluted EPS Guidance and Declares Third-Quarter 2025 Dividend April 24, 2025 PDF Version - Conference Call Scheduled for 9 a.m. EDT Today &nbsp; - EXTON, Pa. , April 24, 2025 /PRNewswire/ -- West Pharmaceutical Services, Inc. (NYSE: WST) today announced its financial results for the first-quarter 2025 and declared a third-quarter 2025 dividend. &nbsp; &nbsp; First-Quarter 2025 Summary (comparisons to prior-year period) Net sales of $698.0 million increased 0.4%; organic net sales growth was 2.1%. Reported-diluted EPS of $1.23 , compared to $1.55 in the same period last year. Adjusted-diluted EPS of $1.45 , compared to $1.56 in the same period last year. The Company is increasing its full year 2025 net sales guidance range to $2....",
