    "content_text": "Dropdown language\nUnited States \nChina - 简体中文\nEurope - English\nIndia - English\nIsrael - English\nJapan - 日本語\nKorea - 한국어\nSingapore - English\nTaiwan - 繁體中文\nUnited States - English\nTrending Topics\nDropdown language\nUnited States \nChina - 简体中文\nEurope - English\nIndia - English\nIsrael - English\nJapan - 日本語\nKorea - 한국어\nSingapore - English\nTaiwan - 繁體中文\nUnited States - English\nProducts & Services \nProducts &amp; Technologies \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"_content_experience-fragments_applied-materials_us_en_site_header_master_jcr:content_root_globalheader_copy_tabs_item-0_item_0_copy_columncontainer_copy_container_copy_2033090085_text-48493\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nProducts & Technologies \nSemiconductor\n\">\nSemiconductor\nDisplay\n\">\nDisplay\nAutomation Software\n\">\nAutomation Software\nServices \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"_content_experience-fragments_applied-materials_us_en_site_header_master_jcr:content_root_globalheader_copy_tabs_item-0_item_0_copy_columncontainer_copy_column1_copy_text-11703\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nServices \nService Solutions \nSupply Chain Solutions \nResources \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"_content_experience-fragments_applied-materials_us_en_site_header_master_jcr:content_root_globalheader_copy_tabs_item-0_item_0_copy_columncontainer_copy_column1_copy_copy_text-87341\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nResources \nProduct Library \nTechnical Glossary \nCompany\nAbout\n\">\nAbout\nCollaboration\n\">\nCollaboration\nCorporate Responsibility\n\">\nCorporate Responsibility\nInvestor Relations\n\">\nInvestor Relations\nNewsroom\n\">\nNewsroom\nApplied Ventures\n\">\nApplied Ventures\nContact\nContact Us \nLocations \nCareers \nNewsroom\n\">\nNewsroom\nInvestor Relations\n\">\nInvestor Relations\nCustomer Portal\n\">\nCustomer Portal\nPartner Portal\n\">\nPartner Portal\nProducts & Services \nProducts &amp; Technologies \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"_content_experience-fragments_applied-materials_us_en_site_header_master_jcr:content_root_globalheader_copy_tabs_item-0_item_0_copy_columncontainer_copy_container_copy_2033090085_text-80590\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nProducts & Technologies \nSemiconductor\n\">\nSemiconductor\nDisplay\n\">\nDisplay\nAutomation Software\n\">\nAutomation Software\nServices \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"_content_experience-fragments_applied-materials_us_en_site_header_master_jcr:content_root_globalheader_copy_tabs_item-0_item_0_copy_columncontainer_copy_column1_copy_text-74023\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nServices \nService Solutions \nSupply Chain Solutions \nResources \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"_content_experience-fragments_applied-materials_us_en_site_header_master_jcr:content_root_globalheader_copy_tabs_item-0_item_0_copy_columncontainer_copy_column1_copy_copy_text-11808\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nResources \nProduct Library \nTechnical Glossary \nCompany\nAbout\n\">\nAbout\nCollaboration\n\">\nCollaboration\nCorporate Responsibility\n\">\nCorporate Responsibility\nInvestor Relations\n\">\nInvestor Relations\nNewsroom\n\">\nNewsroom\nApplied Ventures\n\">\nApplied Ventures\nContact\nContact Us \nLocations \nCareers \nTrending Topics\nStay updated on our content.\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"_content_experience-fragments_applied-materials_us_en_site_blog-subscription-block_master_jcr:content_root_container_columncontainer_container_copy_text_copy-31974\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nStay updated on our content.\nSubscribe \nShare via Facebook \nShare via Twitter \nShare via Linkedin \nShare via Email \nInspiring the Next Generation Across Asia through STEAM Education\nSeptember 8, 2026\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1630550081_1727132271_text-28317\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nSeptember 8, 2026\nAs a global leader in materials engineering, Applied Materials understands that the breakthroughs shaping the future begin with people. Through our Community Impact strategy, we invest in education initiatives that expand access to STEAM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Arts and Mathematics) learning, strengthen community partnerships, and help inspire and prepare young people to thrive in a rapidly evolving world. These efforts reflect Applied's commitment to creating meaningful impact in the communities where employees live and work.\n\\r\\n Home to strong innovation ecosystems, growing talent and rapidly evolving industries, Asia plays an important role in the future of technology and innovation. Across the region, Applied Materials’ community-driven STEAM education programs are expected to reach more than 35,000 students, parents, and educators this year, expanding access to meaningful learning experiences that foster exploration, creativity and problem-solving.\n\\r\\n Action Across Asia\n\\r\\n Across Japan, China, Korea, Taiwan, Singapore and India, Applied brings this commitment to life through local partnerships, employee volunteering and hands-on learning experiences. Programs are developed in partnership with local communities to address their unique needs, while employee volunteers bring science and technology concepts to life through engaging, real-world learning opportunities. The stories that follow show how this shared commitment is represented across diverse cultures and communities throughout Asia.&nbsp; (Regional highlights are presented in order of founding year). \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1630550081_text-42352\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nAs a global leader in materials engineering, Applied Materials understands that the breakthroughs shaping the future begin with people. Through our Community Impact strategy, we invest in education initiatives that expand access to STEAM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Arts and Mathematics) learning, strengthen community partnerships, and help inspire and prepare young people to thrive in a rapidly evolving world. These efforts reflect Applied's commitment to creating meaningful impact in the communities where employees live and work.\nHome to strong innovation ecosystems, growing talent and rapidly evolving industries, Asia plays an important role in the future of technology and innovation. Across the region, Applied Materials’ community-driven STEAM education programs are expected to reach more than 35,000 students, parents, and educators this year, expanding access to meaningful learning experiences that foster exploration, creativity and problem-solving.\nAction Across Asia\nAcross Japan, China, Korea, Taiwan, Singapore and India, Applied brings this commitment to life through local partnerships, employee volunteering and hands-on learning experiences. Programs are developed in partnership with local communities to address their unique needs, while employee volunteers bring science and technology concepts to life through engaging, real-world learning opportunities. The stories that follow show how this shared commitment is represented across diverse cultures and communities throughout Asia. (Regional highlights are presented in order of founding year). \nJapan | Semiconductor Explorers&nbsp; \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_265811918_text-184\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nJapan | Semiconductor Explorers \nSparking curiosity about semiconductors. \n\\r\\n Through STEAM education programs developed with local governments, community partners and employee volunteers, Applied Materials Japan encourages students to explore computational thinking while discovering the role of semiconductors in everyday life.\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_265811918_columncontainer_column1_text-83433\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nSparking curiosity about semiconductors. \nThrough STEAM education programs developed with local governments, community partners and employee volunteers, Applied Materials Japan encourages students to explore computational thinking while discovering the role of semiconductors in everyday life.\nChina | Walking Along the Silk Road \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_text_copy-16239\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nChina | Walking Along the Silk Road \nCulture can be a powerful gateway to science learning. \n\\r\\n Applied Materials China blends science exploration with the history, art and innovations of the ancient Silk Road, offering students a unique lens to discover science.\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_columncontainer_column1_text-38481\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nCulture can be a powerful gateway to science learning. \nApplied Materials China blends science exploration with the history, art and innovations of the ancient Silk Road, offering students a unique lens to discover science.\nKorea | AI &amp; Semiconductor Class\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_133821650_text_copy-74572\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nKorea | AI & Semiconductor Class\nTechnology is best understood through experience. \n\\r\\n Applied Materials Korea's 'AI &amp; Semiconductor Class' helps students explore the connection between AI and semiconductor technologies through hands-on learning experiences that build creativity, engineering skills and systems thinking.\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_133821650_columncontainer_column1_text-26419\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nTechnology is best understood through experience. \nApplied Materials Korea's 'AI & Semiconductor Class' helps students explore the connection between AI and semiconductor technologies through hands-on learning experiences that build creativity, engineering skills and systems thinking.\nTaiwan | Semiconductor Adventurers\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_1489867317_text_copy_copy-68360\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nTaiwan | Semiconductor Adventurers\nCuriosity and creativity grow through exploration. \n\\r\\n Through hands-on learning experiences using building blocks, sponges and simple circuits, Applied Materials Taiwan inspires students to explore semiconductor processes in ways that make engineering concepts tangible, accessible and fun.\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_1489867317_columncontainer_column1_text-87245\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nCuriosity and creativity grow through exploration. \nThrough hands-on learning experiences using building blocks, sponges and simple circuits, Applied Materials Taiwan inspires students to explore semiconductor processes in ways that make engineering concepts tangible, accessible and fun.\nSingapore | Science Exhibition\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_1159715729_text_copy_copy-539\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nSingapore | Science Exhibition\nScience can inspire learning at every stage of life. \n\\r\\n As part of the SG Science Fest, Applied Materials South East Asia engaged visitors of all ages through hands-on experiences inspired by semiconductor manufacturing processes. Through the journey from chip to application, participants gained insights into the semiconductor industry and the innovations that power modern life.\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_1159715729_columncontainer_column1_text-56821\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nScience can inspire learning at every stage of life. \nAs part of the SG Science Fest, Applied Materials South East Asia engaged visitors of all ages through hands-on experiences inspired by semiconductor manufacturing processes. Through the journey from chip to application, participants gained insights into the semiconductor industry and the innovations that power modern life.\nIndia | STEM Learning Program\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_807027653_text_copy_copy-77194\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nIndia | STEM Learning Program\nOpportunity begins with access. \n\\r\\n Through STEM labs, SPARK learning centers, tinkering labs and employee-led mentoring, Applied Materials India is helping bring experiential STEM education to underserved communities and inspiring the next generation of problem-solvers.\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"root_container_container_container_1955866749_2087031018_columncontainer_column1_container_1288976889_807027653_columncontainer_column1_text-58472\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nOpportunity begins with access. \nThrough STEM labs, SPARK learning centers, tinkering labs and employee-led mentoring, Applied Materials India is helping bring experiential STEM education to underserved communities and inspiring the next generation of problem-solvers.",
