    "content_text": "For Immediate Release\nCompany Name:\nRepresentative:\nSecurities Code:\nStock Exchange\nListings:\nInquiries:\nAugust 3, 2026\nSumitomo Chemical Co., Ltd.\nNobuaki Mito\nRepresentative Director & President\n4005\nTokyo Stock Exchange Prime Market\nShoko Wato\nGeneral Manager\nCorporate Communications Dept.\n(Tel: +81-3-5201-0200)\nNotice Concerning the Determination of the Amount of the Reduction of Capital Reserves\nIncreased through the Share Exchange and the Transfer to Other Capital Surplus\nAs announced in Sumitomo Chemical’s press release titled “Reduction in the Amount of Capital\nReserves That Will Increase upon the Share Exchange and Transfer of the Reduced Amount to Other\nCapital Surplus,” dated May 13, 2026, the Company implemented a share exchange effective August\n1, 2026, in which the Company became the wholly owning parent company in the share exchange\nand Koei Chemical Company, Limited became the wholly owned subsidiary in the share exchange\n(the “Share Exchange”). At the same time of the Share Exchange, the Company reduced the entire\namount of capital reserves that had been increased as a result of the Share Exchange and transferred\nthe amount to other capital surplus. The details are as follows. This matter will have no impact on\nthe Company’s operating results.\nDetails\nAmount of reduction in capital reserves: 2,399,926,534 yen, the amount of the increase in capital\nreserves resulting from the Share Exchange\n(Note 1) The amount of the increase in capital reserves resulting from the Share Exchange was\ncalculated in accordance with Article 39 of the Ordinance on Accounting of Companies,\nbased on the fair value of the Company shares (10,603,734 shares) delivered as\nconsideration for the Share Exchange, and amounted to 2,399,926,534 yen.\n(Note 2) This reduction in the amount of capital reserves was made concurrently with the Share\nExchange, by reducing the amount of capital reserves increased as a result of the Share\nExchange. Therefore, after this reduction, the amount of the Company’s capital reserves\nremains unchanged from the amount of capital reserves immediately prior to the Share\nExchange, namely 24,294,406,131 yen.",
