    "content_text": "Wind turbine orders\nAnnounced wind turbine orders \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"styledheading-a04bb2028c\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nAnnounced wind turbine orders \nBelow you will find an overview of announced wind turbine orders from the current year and more than five years back.\n\\r\\n Orders with a&nbsp;total capacity of 1.5 GW or more are disclosed as company announcements. Orders with a capacity below 1.5 GW may be published as news releases by the local business units. All announced orders will figure in the lists below, with a link to either a company announcement or a press release.&nbsp;\n\\r\\n &nbsp;\n\\r\\n &nbsp;\n\\r\\n &nbsp;\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"text-77947da3ab\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nBelow you will find an overview of announced wind turbine orders from the current year and more than five years back.\nOrders with a total capacity of 1.5 GW or more are disclosed as company announcements. Orders with a capacity below 1.5 GW may be published as news releases by the local business units. All announced orders will figure in the lists below, with a link to either a company announcement or a press release. \nNote that the volume (MW) of unannounced orders for a specific quarter will only be added to the year-to-date total&nbsp; with the disclosure of the interim report for the same quarter.&nbsp;\n\\r\\n &nbsp;\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"text-2e0c7bcfbb\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nNote that the volume (MW) of unannounced orders for a specific quarter will only be added to the year-to-date total with the disclosure of the interim report for the same quarter. \nQuick links\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"text-fc0e906b4d\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nQuick links\nCompany news\nFinancial calendar\nOrders received in the current year \n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"styledheading-5b61f6d7ab\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nOrders received in the current year \nNote that the bulk of unannounced orders received in a quarter will only be added to the total MW in connection with the disclosure of the Interim Report for the quarter.&nbsp;\n\\r\\n\"}}\" id=\"text-590d8a4a37\" class=\"cmp-text\">\nNote that the bulk of unannounced orders received in a quarter will only be added to the total MW in connection with the disclosure of the Interim Report for the quarter. \nFirst quarter 2026 \n\\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MW\n\\r\\n \\r\\n\nDate\n\\r\\n \\r\\n Title\n\\r\\n \\r\\n Onshore\n\\r\\n \\r\\n Offshore\n\\r\\n \\r\\n\n21-01-26 \\r\\n Vestas announces a new order in South Korea \\r\\n 31 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n05-02-26 \\r\\n Vestas wins 26 MW order in New Zealand \\r\\n 26 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n20-02-26 \\r\\n Vestas increases offshore momentum in Europe with 1.38 GW offshore order in the United Kingdom \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n 1,380 \\r\\n\n02-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas announces 50 MW order in Germany \\r\\n 50 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n10-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas builds offshore momentum in Europe with another 1.38 GW order in the United Kingdom \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n 1,380 \\r\\n\n18-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas announces a new order in Japan \\r\\n 17 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n23-03-26 \\r\\n Equinor and Rio Energy order Vestas turbines for the 230 MW Esquina do Vento Wind Project in Brazil, fully developed by Vestas \\r\\n 230 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n24-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas announces new orders in France for a total of 59 MW \\r\\n 59 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n24-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas announces new order in Germany \\r\\n 29 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n25-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas adds 505 MW to Q1 order intake \\r\\n 505 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n30-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas announces new orders in Germany \\r\\n 60 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n31-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas announces two new orders for a total of 97 MW \\r\\n 97 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n31-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas announces a new onshore order in the United Kingdom \\r\\n 90 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n31-02-26 \\r\\n Vestas wins 62 MW onshore order in Germany \\r\\n 62 \\r\\n &nbsp; \\r\\n\n31-03-26 \\r\\n Vestas adds 135 MW to Q1 order intake \\