th HER2-mutant non-small cell lung cancer \r\nNot intended for U.S. and UK Media\nFirst targeted therapy approved in Japan for this indication, with use across all lines of therapy, including first-line treatment / Approval is based on results from the ongoing Phase I/II SOHO-01 trial evaluating the efficacy and safety of &hellip; \nRead more\r\nTags\nDocCheck-EN \r\nSPECIALIZED PRESS \r\nExport-LatestNews \r\nExport-IR \r\nExport-PH \r\nShow previous item \r\nShow next item \r\nAnnual Report\nopens in new window \nQuarterly Statement\nopens in new window \nImpact Report\nopens in new window \nNewsroom \nSign up for our Newsletter\nWe will keep you informed about the latest news.\nSign up",
