    "content_text": "Market Announcement\n31 August 2026\nAustralian Strategic Materials Limited (ASX: ASM) – Removal\nfrom Official List\nDescription\nAustralian Strategic Materials Limited (‘ASM’) will be removed from the Official List at the close of trading\ntoday, Monday, 31 August 2026 in accordance with Listing Rule 17.11, following implementation of the scheme\nof arrangement between ASM and its shareholders in connection with the acquisition of all the issued capital in\nASM by EFR Critical Materials Pty Ltd, a wholly owned subsidiary of Energy Fuels Inc.\nIssued by\nASX Supervision\n31 August 2026 Market Announcement 1/1\nASX Limited ASX Customer Service Centre 131 279 | asx.com.au\n#11127233v1",
