    "content_text": "Register for the 2026 full-year results presentation\r\n2026 full-year results presentation\nRenishaw plc's full-year results for the year ended 30 June 2026 will be announced on Wednesday 23 September 2026 at 07:00 BST. An in-person presentation will be held later that morning, hosted by Will Lee, Chief Executive Officer and John Shipsey, Chief Financial Officer. \nThe presentation will take place at 08:30 BST at the Peel Hunt offices at 100 Liverpool Street, London (registration and refreshments from 08:00), with an accompanying live video webcast. The session will include the opportunity for questions and will end at 09:30 BST.\nPlease click here to register for the in-person event on 23 September at Peel Hunt. Registrations will close on Thursday 17 September.\nIf you are unable to join in-person but would like to attend the live webcast, then please register here .\nA recording of the presentation will be made available by Thursday 24 September 2026.\nWill Lee \nNo description available\n[320 x 260] \r\n[108kB] \r\nJohn Shipsey, Chief Financial Officer \nJohn Shipsey, Chief Financial Officer at Renishaw\n[320 x 260] \r\n[38kB] \r\nInvestors homepage",
