    "content_text": "SX Brands 2024 Selected\nJapanese \nApr 23, 2024\nJoint press release with Tokyo Stock Exchange\nEconomic & Industrial Policy \nThe Ministry of Economy, Trade and Industry (METI) and Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) have started a project for selecting and awarding as SX (Sustainability Transformation) Brands a group of progressive companies that enhance their ability to create a source of funds for growth in a sustainable manner through SX to realize the improvement of corporate value. \n&nbsp; \nFrom October 2 to November 30, 2023, METI and TSE opened a call for TSE-listed companies to apply to become SX Brands and selected 15 companies as SX Brands 2024 under the first round. METI and TSE are scheduled to hold a commendation ceremony for SX Brands 2024 taking the opportunity of the SX Symposium 2024 to be held on May 24, 2024.\r\n1. Outline of SX Brand\nSX is an initiative in which companies strive to improve long-term and sustainable corporate value by synchronizing the sustainability of society with that of itself while carrying out the necessary management and business reforms to achieve such synchronization. \nMETI and TSE have started a project for selecting and awarding as SX Brands a group of progressive companies that enhance their ability to create a source of funds for growth in a sustainable manner through SX to realize the improvement of corporate value. \nWe expect that, by publicizing SX Brands, outstanding companies’ progressive efforts for SX management will be disseminated among a wide range of other Japanese companies and that companies’ dialogues and engagement with investors inside and outside Japan will be further promoted, thereby not only expanding investment in Japan but also improving the evaluation of Japanese companies in capital markets.\n2.&nbsp;Successful companies selected as SX Brands 2024\nFrom October 2 to November 30, 2023, METI and TSE opened a call for TSE-listed companies to apply to become SX Brands 2024. We selected 15 companies as below from among the applicants as SX Brands 2024 based on the results of the examination by the SX Brand Evaluation Committee. \n&nbsp; \nSector \nCode \nCompany Name \nFoods \n2802 \nAjinomoto Co., Inc. \nElectronic Appliances \n6645 \nOMRON Corporation \nFoods \n2503 \nKirin Holdings Company, Limited \nInformation & Communication \n9433 \nKDDI CORPORATION \nPharmaceutical \n4568 \nDAIICHI SANKYO COMPANY, LIMITED \nMachinery \n6367 \nDAIKIN INDUSTRIES, LTD. \nElectronic Appliances \n8035 \nTokyo Electron Limited \nChemicals \n4186 \nTOKYO OHKA KOGYO CO., LTD. \nAir Transportation \n9201 \nJapan Airlines Co., Ltd. \nElectronic Appliances \n6501 \nHitachi, Ltd. \nChemicals \n4901 \nFUJIFILM Holdings Corporation \nRubber Products \n5108 \nBRIDGESTONE CORPORATION \nWholesale Trade \n8031 \nMITSUI & CO., LTD. \nFoods \n2269 \nMeiji Holdings Co., Ltd. \nChemicals \n8113 \nUNICHARM CORPORATION \nNote: Successful companies are as of April 23, 2024.\n3. SX Brands 2024 Report\nMETI and TSE aim to disseminate outstanding companies’ progressive efforts for SX among a wide range of other Japanese companies and further promote companies’ dialogues and engagement with investors inside and outside Japan, and to this end, we announced SX Brands 2024 and also prepared and published the SX Brands 2024 Report, which explains the selected companies’ efforts. An English translation of the SX Brands Report will be available by the day of the SX Symposium 2024. \n4. Convening the SX Symposium 2024\nThe SX Symposium 2024 will be held on May 24, 2024. The symposium will provide a commendation ceremony for SX Brands 2024, presentations by selected companies, a panel discussion by investors and companies in Japan and the United States, and a networking event between participants and companies and investors.\nApplication Form (moves to an external site) \nDate and time: Friday, May 24, 2024; from 1:00 p.m. to 5:40 p.m. (tentative) \nVenue: Iino Hall \nOrganizers: METI and TSE \nCooperator: Nikkei Inc. \nProgram (tentative): \n- Opening remarks by organizers \n- Awarding successful companies selected as SX Brands 2024 \n- Presentations by the selected companies \n- Panel discussion by investors and companies in Japan and the United States (this event will be held under the framework of the Japan-U.S. Commercial and Industrial Partnership (JUCIP).) \n- Networking event\nRelated Links\nSX Brands to be Established (February 10, 2023) \nIto Review 3.0 (Ito Review SX Edition) \nGuidance for Integrated Corporate Disclosure and Company-Investor Dialogue for Collaborative Value Creation 2.0 \nTSE news release \nDivision in Charge\n- Corporate Accounting, Disclosure and CSR Policy Office, Economic and Industrial Policy Bureau \n- Industrial Finance Division, Economic and Industrial Policy Bureau\nRelated website\nCorporate Accounting, Disclosure and CSR Policy \nRelated website\nCorporate Accounting, Disclosure and CSR Policy \nDownload(To Adobe site)",
