    "content_excerpt": "Information for shareholders of JENOPTIK AG on data protection with regard to registered shares The following information instructs you about the processing of your personal data by JENOPTIK AG, Jena (hereinafter referred to as “we”, “us” or “the company”) and the rights to which you are entitled in accordance with data protection law. Your personal data is all the information that may be assigned to you as an identified or identifiable natural person (hereinafter referred to as “personal data”), such as your name or contact data. We take the protection of your personal data very seriously and process your data in accordance with the General Data Processing Regulation EU 2016/679 (“GDPR”) and the applicable national data protection laws. Who is responsible for the data processing? The pers...",
