    "content_excerpt": "Special Feature Dialogue: Investor × CEO Back to Core Chemical Roots: Redesigning Profit Structure and Advancing the Green Specialty Strategy Left: Manabu Chikumoto Representative Corporate Executive Officer, President and CEO, Mitsubishi Chemical Group Corporation Right: Hiroyasu Koike President and CEO, Nomura Asset Management Co., Ltd. Article on Nomura Asset Management 30/07/25 The Mitsubishi Chemical Group, a key player in Japan's longstanding integrated chemical industry, is aiming to overcome the sluggish performance of its Chemicals business by implementing business portfolio transformation and profit growth strategies based on three disciplined approaches in business operations and three criteria for business selection. Hiroyasu Koike, President and CEO, Nomura Asset Management Co...",
