    "content_text": "15,83 15,82\n8,43\n5,11\nOur Vision – Brighter Futures with the Power of Light.\n7,88 Investor Relations Presentation I August/September 2026\n© Copyright Jenoptik. All rights reserved.\n15,83 15,82\n8,43\nDisclaimer\n5,11\nThis presentation can contain forward-looking statements that are based on current expectations and certain assumptions of the management of\nthe Jenoptik Group. A variety of known and unknown risks, uncertainties and other factors can cause the actual results, the financial situation, the\ndevelopment or the performance of the company to be materially different from the announced forward-looking statements. Such factors can\nbe, among others, geopolitical conflicts, pandemic diseases, changes in currency exchange rates and interest rates, energy supply, the\nintroduction of competing products or the change of the business strategy. The company does not assume any obligation to update such\nforward-looking statements in this document in the light of future developments.\n7,88\nJenoptik Investor Relations Presentation 2\n15,83 15,82\n8,43\nAgenda\n5,11\nCompany overview\nDivisional set-up\nResults H1/2026 and outlook\nAppendix\n7,88\nJenoptik Investor Relations Presentation 3\n15,83 15,82\n8,43\nJenoptik at a glance – a leading globally operating photonics group\n5,11\n1991\n>80\n~4,300\n~2.4bn1\nFiscal year 2025\n~1.05 bn\n18.4\nYear of foundation\nRepresented in countries\nEmployees worldwide\nMarket capitalization in euros\nRevenue in euros\nEBITDA margin in %\n1as of 14.8.2026\n7,88\nJenoptikInvestor Relations Presentation\nOur Mission\nThe Leading Light\nIn the Application of\nPhotonics\nFocus on four growth areas\n−\n−\n−\n−\nSemiconductor technology\nMedical technology\nMetrology\nSmart Mobility\n4\n15,83 15,82\n8,43\nClear focus on attractive markets\n5,11 Semiconductor & Advanced Metrology & Production\nManufacturing Solutions\nOptics, Micro-optics\nPrecision components\n42%\n20%\nOEM businesses\nOEM generate Solutions\nbusinesses ~2/3 of revenue businesses\nBiophotonics Smart Mobility Solutions\n12%\n23% 3%\nBased on FY 2025 data\n7,88 Semi Bio Metrology Mobility Others\nJenoptik Investor Relations Presentation 5\n15,83 15,82\n8,43 Strong value proposition:\nLeading photonics expertise combined with strong customer relationships\n5,11\nCustomer access / relationship Technology\nApplication Industrial\nJoint R&D Shared R&D Designed-in manufacturing Manufacturing\nprogrammes roadmaps solutions excellence capacity\nknow how\nEvolution\nSupplier Joint R&D projects Joint roadmaps Joint ecosystem (Partner)\n7,88\nJenoptikInvestor Relations Presentation 6\n15,83 15,82\n8,43 Delivering designed-in modules and components for performance-critical\napplications to a strong OEM key account customer base\n5,11\nSemiconductor &\nAdvanced Manufacturing\nWe enable the digital age\nBiophotonics\n7,88\nJenoptikInvestor Relations Presentation\n−\n−\n−\n−\n−\n−\nMain products & applications\nOptical and micro-optical modules and subsystems for\nsemiconductor equipment industry\nMicro-optic based sensors for precision alignment in\nlithography systems\nHigh-end precision optics for inspection systems\nOptical modules and sub-systems for global Medtech &\nLife Science industry\nKey applications served include dentistry, ophthalmology,\nsurgery and DNA-sequencing\nServe defense market with laser range finders,\nthermal imaging cameras and infrared and polymer optics\n7\n15,83 15,82\n8,43 Solution businesses address several end markets with\nhigh-precision measurement technologies\n5,11\n−\n−\n−\n−\n−\n−\n7,88\nMain products & applications\nMetrology & Production\nHigh-end testing solutions for electronics (e.g. smart phone Solutions\ncameras and AR/VR devices) and optics manufacturing\nTesting equipment for global automotive industry, e.g.\nmetrology for mechanical parts, testing of ADAS\nProduction solutions, e.g. laser-based airbag perforation\nProvider of solutions for traffic law enforcement,\ne.