    "content_text": "00:00:03:05 - 00:00:07:11\nAt ABB, we create value for all our stakeholders,\n00:00:08:02 - 00:00:11:15\nstarting with our shareholders of course,\rbut also our end-customers,\n00:00:11:15 - 00:00:15:13\nemployees, partners\rand the communities where we work.\n00:00:16:22 - 00:00:20:01\nIn 2025, we had to navigate\n00:00:20:01 - 00:00:23:23\ngeopolitical tensions,\reconomic uncertainty,\n00:00:23:23 - 00:00:28:09\nand the rapid advance\rof disruptive technologies like AI.\n00:00:29:16 - 00:00:32:11\nWe continued to adapt our tactics\n00:00:32:11 - 00:00:35:11\nbut remain true to our purpose and values.\n00:00:36:11 - 00:00:39:11\nThat's how we run our business\rfor the long term.\n00:00:40:06 - 00:00:42:02\nAnd it works.\n00:00:42:02 - 00:00:45:04\n2025 was another record year for ABB.\n00:00:45:23 - 00:00:48:10\nOur performance shows that\n00:00:48:10 - 00:00:52:22\nwe are well positioned to navigate\rmegatrends like automation,\n00:00:53:04 - 00:00:56:04\nelectrification and energy security.\n00:00:56:21 - 00:00:59:06\nOur local-for-local strategy\n00:00:59:06 - 00:01:02:06\nof designing\rand producing close to our customers\n00:01:02:12 - 00:01:05:12\nmakes us resilient and self-sufficient\n00:01:05:14 - 00:01:08:07\nin our main markets.\n00:01:08:07 - 00:01:10:14\nWe are confident about ABB's\n00:01:10:14 - 00:01:13:14\nprospects for 2026 and beyond.\n00:01:14:16 - 00:01:15:01\nThis is\n00:01:15:01 - 00:01:18:01\nreflected in the updated financial targets\n00:01:18:04 - 00:01:21:16\nthat we announced\rat our Capital Markets Day in November.\n00:01:22:11 - 00:01:25:11\nIn our Integrated Report for 2025,\n00:01:25:24 - 00:01:30:20\nwe describe how we are planning\rto achieve our targets and how,\n00:01:31:01 - 00:01:36:10\nevery single day, we help industries\routrun leaner and cleaner.",
