    "content_text": "00:00:04:07 - 00:00:07:03\nThis has been ABB's best year yet.\n00:00:07:03 - 00:00:10:24\nAs our Integrated Report shows,\rwe ended a record\n00:00:10:24 - 00:00:13:24\n2025 performance on a high note.\n00:00:14:00 - 00:00:17:13\nI'm very proud of all the ABB teams\rwho made this success\n00:00:17:13 - 00:00:20:13\npossible. During 2025,\n00:00:20:15 - 00:00:24:02\nwe saw strong demand for electrification\rand automation\n00:00:24:02 - 00:00:27:02\nsolutions in most customer segments.\n00:00:27:14 - 00:00:30:07\nWe also continue\rto improve our profitability\n00:00:30:07 - 00:00:34:17\neven in the face of challenges\rlike tariffs and higher material prices.\n00:00:35:14 - 00:00:39:13\nAnd we continue to be recognized\rwith good sustainability ratings\n00:00:39:13 - 00:00:43:24\nand make good progress in walking\rthe sustainability talk at our own sites.\n00:00:45:03 - 00:00:46:18\nIn 2025,\n00:00:46:18 - 00:00:51:03\ntechnology remained at the heart\rof how we create value for our customers,\n00:00:51:15 - 00:00:55:24\nand we invested $1.3\rbillion in research and development.\n00:00:57:04 - 00:01:01:09\nIn 2026, we will\rcontinue to build on our strengths.\n00:01:01:13 - 00:01:06:05\nWe have a strong position,\rgreat solutions, and high performing teams.\n00:01:06:16 - 00:01:10:05\nThat's why we are confident\rthat we will deliver on our updated\n00:01:10:05 - 00:01:14:22\nfinancial targets as we help\rour customers outrun, leaner and cleaner.",
