    "discovery_snippet": "Vadzo Imaging Debuts Armor-821CRS: the AR0821 FPD-Link IV Camera Delivers 8MP 4K HDR, High-Performance ISP, and Power over Coax with Smart ROI for Multi-Camera Surround-View and Region-Based Object Detection in Autonomous Vehicles &nbsp;&nbsp; newswire.com",
