    "content_text": "Earnings To Watch: Bewi ASA (OSL:BEWI) Q2 2026 -- GF Value Sees 11% Downside\nGuruFocus News \nAugust 18, 2026 2 min read \nBEWI.OL \n+0.75% \nBEWIO.OL \n0.00% \nThis article first appeared on GuruFocus . \nBewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) is set to release its Q2 2026 earnings on Aug 19, 2026. The consensus estimate for Q2 2026 revenue is 2447.65 million, and the earnings are expected to come in at 0.15 per share. The full year 2026's revenue is expected to be $9272.73 million and the earnings are expected to be $-0.16 per share. More detailed estimate data can be found on the Forecast page \nBewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) Estimates Trends \nWarning! GuruFocus has detected 10 Warning Signs with OSL:BEWI. \nIs OSL:BEWI fairly valued? Test your thesis with our free DCF calculator. \nRevenue estimates for Bewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) have declined from $9274.54 million to $9272.73 million for the full year 2026 and declined from $9667.04 million to $9646.14 million for 2027 over the past 90 days. Earnings estimates for Bewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) have declined from $-0.07 per share to $-0.16 per share for the full year 2026 and declined from $0.65 per share to $0.49 per share for 2027 over the past 90 days. \nBewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) Reported History \nIn the previous quarter of 2026-03-31, Bewi ASA's ( OSL:BEWI ) actual revenue was $2165.27 million, which missed analysts' revenue expectations of $2199.07 million by -1.54%. Bewi ASA's ( OSL:BEWI ) actual earnings were $-0.55 per share, which missed analysts' earnings expectations of $-0.164 per share by -232.32%. After releasing the results, Bewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) was up by 9.86% in one day. \nEarnings To Watch: Bewi ASA (OSL:BEWI) Q2 2026 -- GF Value Sees 11% Downside · us.finance.gurufocus Bewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) 12 Month Price Targets \nBased on the one-year price targets offered by 3 analysts, the average target price for Bewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) is $21.01 with a high estimate of $24.01 and a low estimate of $17. The average target implies a downside of -0.45% from the current price of $21.1. \nBased on GuruFocus estimates, the estimated GF Value for Bewi ASA ( OSL:BEWI ) in one year is $18.82, suggesting a downside of -10.81% from the current price of $21.1. \nBased on the consensus recommendation from 4 brokerage firms, Bewi ASA's ( OSL:BEWI ) average brokerage recommendation is currently 2.3, indicating an \"Outperform\" status. The rating scale ranges from 1 to 5, where 1 signifies Strong Buy, and 5 denotes Sell. \nEarnings To Watch: Bewi ASA (OSL:BEWI) Q2 2026 -- GF Value Sees 11% Downside · us.finance.gurufocus \nView Comments \nTerms and Privacy Policy \nYour privacy controls \nWA Consumer Health Privacy Policy \nMore Info",
